WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:05.460
We die trusting the living who follow
to find meaning in our lives!

00:06.110 --> 00:11.360
That is the sole method in which
we can rebel against this cruel world!

00:12.030 --> 00:13.530
My soldiers, rage!

00:14.200 --> 00:16.030
My soldiers, scream!

00:16.620 --> 00:19.410
My soldiers, fight!

00:32.880 --> 00:34.010
The commander!

00:34.010 --> 00:36.580
Don't look back! Charge!

02:09.980 --> 02:14.980
"Hero"

02:21.990 --> 02:23.230
How pitiful...

02:24.240 --> 02:27.120
To never learn from the
mistakes of history...

02:27.790 --> 02:31.980
It's a tragedy how King Reiss
stole their memories of the world.

02:32.580 --> 02:35.130
That's why they're
repeating the same mistakes.

02:35.750 --> 02:39.010
In the end, they'll send every
last person in the walls,

02:39.010 --> 02:42.370
down to the children and
elderly, on a suicide charge.

02:43.050 --> 02:46.280
Saying if they're going to die,
they may as well die proud.

02:46.640 --> 02:48.140
It's bullshit!

02:50.440 --> 02:52.400
I crushed it into dust?

02:54.190 --> 02:55.800
What's gotten into me?

02:56.610 --> 02:58.510
Why are you getting worked up?

02:59.110 --> 03:01.160
You're not like your father, right?

03:01.660 --> 03:03.410
You've gotta try to enjoy things.

03:04.490 --> 03:08.790
So let's turn them all into
proud little chunks of meat!

03:08.950 --> 03:11.730
The second volley is coming! Fire!

03:17.880 --> 03:18.650
It's coming...

03:23.970 --> 03:25.550
Is this how I die?

03:27.810 --> 03:29.780
I wonder what Hitch is doing...

03:31.310 --> 03:34.110
Wait, I bet she's still in bed...

03:36.520 --> 03:37.820
Sounds nice...

03:38.780 --> 03:41.900
I don't get it... Why am I,
at a time like this...?

03:53.370 --> 03:55.130
Yeah!

03:55.130 --> 03:56.920
Game over!

03:57.630 --> 04:00.670
You like that?
I changed how I threw the pitch.

04:01.550 --> 04:03.340
Now you're done for.

04:09.770 --> 04:10.860
Fire!

04:14.520 --> 04:19.150
Like I said... How is firing those
things going to help you?

04:21.240 --> 04:26.370
All that screaming...
What good is it going to do you?!

04:36.000 --> 04:38.930
Aww, you poor things...

04:42.920 --> 04:43.510
Hmm?

04:45.510 --> 04:46.090
What's that?

04:47.220 --> 04:49.190
My Titans have fallen...

05:03.360 --> 05:04.110
Huh?

05:04.900 --> 05:07.530
I need to watch out for a single soldier?

05:07.530 --> 05:10.000
Yes. Captain Levi is dangerous.

05:11.410 --> 05:12.910
Is this Levi?

05:14.750 --> 05:15.580
My nape!

05:18.330 --> 05:19.210
What the...?

05:19.750 --> 05:20.920
I can't see a thing!

05:22.420 --> 05:23.710
Did he take out my eyes?

05:25.970 --> 05:26.720
My legs!

05:28.800 --> 05:31.810
What happened to all that
fun you were having?!

05:34.020 --> 05:35.270
Tsk! I'll harden!

05:35.980 --> 05:37.310
Shoot, I won't make it!

05:37.390 --> 05:39.790
Come on, let's try to enjoy this!

06:02.500 --> 06:06.510
After transforming, if your
body's severely damaged,

06:06.510 --> 06:09.260
it's too busy healing to let you transform.

06:09.550 --> 06:11.010
Isn't that right?

06:14.060 --> 06:15.980
Hey, answer me.

06:16.230 --> 06:18.050
Learn some manners.

06:19.900 --> 06:21.930
I can't kill him yet...

06:22.520 --> 06:25.520
Isn't anyone out there still alive?

06:26.240 --> 06:32.430
If they are, even on the brink of death,
this injection will make them a Titan.

06:33.030 --> 06:37.330
We can have them eat this guy
and steal the Beast Titan's power.

06:38.000 --> 06:39.710
Someone, just one...

06:40.500 --> 06:42.260
...I can bring back to life.

06:58.100 --> 06:59.390
Hey...

06:59.390 --> 07:01.060
Where are you going? Stop...

07:02.650 --> 07:05.650
All of you! Go kill him!

07:13.030 --> 07:16.660
It hurts! You've done it now, Levi!

07:16.660 --> 07:17.860
It hurts!

07:18.540 --> 07:21.250
But your weapons have to be all used up.

07:21.500 --> 07:23.830
With this, you'll all be wiped out!

07:23.830 --> 07:27.250
That might've been a close one,
but victory is ours!

07:27.800 --> 07:28.710
Wait...

07:29.670 --> 07:31.760
I made a promise to him...

07:33.180 --> 07:35.550
...that I'd kill you no matter what.

07:37.140 --> 07:38.570
I promised!

07:47.570 --> 07:51.740
Why... am I... alive?

07:52.490 --> 07:53.320
The others...

07:56.700 --> 07:57.510
Hey!

07:58.660 --> 08:00.910
Is anyone else alive?!

08:06.380 --> 08:07.380
That bastard...

08:08.090 --> 08:10.130
To think he's seriously alive...

08:11.130 --> 08:13.170
Why won't he just stay dead?

08:14.130 --> 08:17.760
What the hell do we do...
against something like that?!

08:19.640 --> 08:21.140
Hey, Armin...

08:21.560 --> 08:24.650
I think having Eren escape
is the best we can do.

08:25.440 --> 08:26.520
He's thinner...

08:27.190 --> 08:27.800
Huh?

08:28.270 --> 08:32.030
The Colossal Titan has
gotten a little skinnier.

08:33.990 --> 08:35.760
It's just like Hange said!

08:36.070 --> 08:38.950
The Colossal Titan is weak
in a battle of attrition!

08:40.540 --> 08:42.410
Remember Eren's experiments!

08:43.750 --> 08:46.120
He could only transform up to three times.

08:46.580 --> 08:51.860
If that's the case for a 15-meter Titan,
a 60-meter one might be less efficient!

08:52.510 --> 08:54.310
And there's his steam attack, too!

08:54.720 --> 09:00.450
I bet it's consuming everything except
his skeleton to produce that steam!

09:01.470 --> 09:03.060
So what are you saying?

09:03.060 --> 09:03.920
Armin...

09:04.690 --> 09:05.800
I have a plan.

09:06.440 --> 09:08.360
You all need to draw Reiner away.

09:08.900 --> 09:11.440
Eren and I will defeat Bertholdt ourselves.

09:14.240 --> 09:16.990
The two of us can win and
I'm going to prove it.

09:19.450 --> 09:23.080
All right. Leave Reiner to the rest of us.

09:24.660 --> 09:26.380
Took long enough, dummy.

09:27.000 --> 09:29.210
I really thought we were goners.

09:35.420 --> 09:40.470
I don't know why, but when it comes
to taking back freedom...

09:43.180 --> 09:45.090
...strength flows through me.

09:54.360 --> 09:57.860
If this plan goes well, I...

09:58.280 --> 10:00.310
...I won't get to look at the sea...

10:03.290 --> 10:06.760
For some reason, when I think
of the outside world...

10:07.290 --> 10:09.220
...courage flows through me.

10:15.960 --> 10:17.250
Eren, wake up!

10:20.340 --> 10:22.040
Let's go look at the sea!

10:47.540 --> 10:50.370
Eren, that sums up my plan.

10:51.540 --> 10:56.620
As long as we properly execute it
and manage to trick Bertholdt,

10:57.460 --> 11:00.760
this battle... is ours for the taking.

11:02.470 --> 11:06.850
Got it?! We've gotta trust that Eren
and Armin can handle Bertholdt!

11:07.060 --> 11:10.480
We just need to keep Reiner
away from them if we can!

11:11.350 --> 11:13.730
Let's keep him occupied
from a safe distance!

11:14.060 --> 11:15.070
Roger!

11:22.660 --> 11:23.990
He ignored us?!

11:23.990 --> 11:26.870
That jerk! He's changing his focus to Eren?

11:28.160 --> 11:29.410
We'll just have to kill him!

11:29.750 --> 11:30.580
Mikasa!

11:51.560 --> 11:52.520
Hey!

11:52.520 --> 11:56.690
If we can't get Reiner's attention,
we have to finish him off right here!

11:56.900 --> 11:59.190
It's on us to protect Eren and Armin!

12:00.900 --> 12:01.990
Yeah, I know...

12:02.740 --> 12:04.540
We've only got three Thunder Spears left!

12:04.910 --> 12:06.490
Shit! But...

12:06.490 --> 12:08.200
We've gotta try anyways!

12:08.200 --> 12:11.040
'Cuz unless we fight, we can't win!

12:12.830 --> 12:15.600
What was that? What got me?

12:16.630 --> 12:18.550
A single attack took out my knee...

12:19.880 --> 12:21.950
I can't remember much since then...

12:23.300 --> 12:25.010
I'm blowing this whole area away.

12:25.680 --> 12:29.760
If you can, lie down with your
Titan body facing upwards.

12:30.720 --> 12:31.770
Bertholdt...

12:32.480 --> 12:35.330
What the hell happened to me?

12:35.850 --> 12:40.110
I don't know what's going on...
and I don't have much strength left.

12:40.110 --> 12:43.150
But... I know Eren's over there.

12:43.780 --> 12:48.660
And as long as we capture Eren,
that should still mean that we win.

12:49.660 --> 12:51.340
Isn't that right, Bertholdt?

12:51.910 --> 12:56.290
I'll deal with these chumps quickly...
and come running to back you up.

12:57.130 --> 13:00.380
Reiner must be facing the four
who went that way.

13:00.840 --> 13:06.200
Strange... Only Eren and those guys
in the 104th survived the explosion?

13:07.640 --> 13:11.220
To be perfectly honest,
I hoped to blow everyone up.

13:12.140 --> 13:15.710
But I'm used to these sorts of
trials, Armin...

13:16.150 --> 13:19.880
What's the point of waking Eren
when he's all battered like that?

13:20.860 --> 13:22.320
I want you to show me.

13:22.820 --> 13:25.950
What will you leave behind
in your final moments?

13:27.990 --> 13:30.450
I know it's a plan I thought up myself,

13:30.830 --> 13:35.540
but its success mostly depends on
how long I can hold out for.

13:37.420 --> 13:39.790
Armin, don't tell me you're...

13:40.750 --> 13:44.840
Eren... Sorry, but I can't die
till I look at the sea.

13:45.510 --> 13:48.840
So I'll have to call it quits
before it gets out of hand.

13:49.390 --> 13:50.970
The rest is up to you.

13:51.180 --> 13:55.020
Y-You know, because I'm just not a hero.

13:55.810 --> 13:58.020
No... You're wrong...

13:58.810 --> 14:00.600
The Armin I know is...

14:01.190 --> 14:03.530
Eren... You should know.

14:04.070 --> 14:06.730
We promised to go to
the sea together, right?

14:07.450 --> 14:09.700
Have I ever lied to you in my life?

14:14.580 --> 14:18.240
So no matter what happens,
stick to my plan till the end!

14:33.310 --> 14:34.640
Sh-Shit...

14:42.980 --> 14:44.230
Eren!

14:44.730 --> 14:47.740
I knew it... This battle is already won.

14:48.490 --> 14:53.990
He probably has a severe concussion
and can't even stand on his own.

14:55.240 --> 14:56.750
Enough of this...

14:57.250 --> 14:58.540
Let's end it!

15:11.930 --> 15:13.030
Armin...

15:13.760 --> 15:15.950
All the way to the very end...

15:16.680 --> 15:18.090
...you fought well.

15:22.310 --> 15:24.540
Eren! Armin!

15:25.860 --> 15:28.610
No... We left it to them...

15:28.610 --> 15:30.360
We're going to kill Reiner.

15:30.740 --> 15:35.370
If there's one way to take Reiner out
with three Thunder Spears, this is it.

15:36.120 --> 15:38.900
We'll pick a fight with him
while he still can't move.

15:39.250 --> 15:43.580
Either way this fight goes,
this is where it ends.

15:45.540 --> 15:46.690
Bring it on.

15:52.180 --> 15:56.560
Reiner!

15:57.510 --> 15:59.060
First, I go as the decoy.

16:01.690 --> 16:04.940
Conny and Sasha will follow
with two Thunder Spears...

16:05.770 --> 16:08.980
...and aim for Reiner's
jaw from both sides!

16:15.320 --> 16:16.280
Sasha!

16:16.700 --> 16:17.450
Jean!

16:19.790 --> 16:21.290
One of them missed...

16:23.000 --> 16:26.460
If we blow off his jaw,
Reiner's mouth should open up!

16:26.710 --> 16:31.090
Mikasa can use the last Thunder Spear
to hit his nape through the mouth!

16:32.680 --> 16:34.150
His mouth isn't open...

16:34.550 --> 16:37.160
Even so, I have to do it!

16:41.230 --> 16:42.270
Why?

16:42.810 --> 16:44.510
I can't blow Armin away...

16:45.190 --> 16:46.940
Why won't his anchor come loose?

16:47.770 --> 16:50.080
He shouldn't even be able to get close!

16:51.900 --> 16:53.240
I knew it...

16:53.570 --> 16:55.570
His bones aren't being consumed!

16:55.950 --> 16:58.660
The anchors stay put if
they're not in muscle!

16:58.740 --> 17:04.160
But most importantly, he can't move
his body while he's emitting steam!

17:04.620 --> 17:08.210
But, Armin... Is this how you go out?

17:08.840 --> 17:12.180
In all your wisdom, the best plan
you could come up with...

17:12.720 --> 17:16.370
...was to get scorched to death like this?

17:17.260 --> 17:20.470
I can't breathe! I have to let go...

17:20.850 --> 17:22.560
No! Not yet!

17:23.060 --> 17:24.480
It's not enough!

17:25.390 --> 17:28.260
I've gotta buy more time!

17:29.360 --> 17:32.150
What's he trying to accomplish?
A diversion?

17:32.690 --> 17:35.330
But Eren's still beat to a pulp over there.

17:35.950 --> 17:38.870
Mikasa and them have their
hands full with Reiner.

17:39.950 --> 17:42.010
There isn't anything else to it?

17:42.450 --> 17:44.830
If this really is the end for you...

17:45.750 --> 17:48.960
All right... I'll make it quick for you.

17:53.800 --> 17:54.700
Hold on!

17:55.510 --> 17:56.960
Don't let go!

17:57.930 --> 17:59.260
I entrust it to Eren!

18:00.350 --> 18:03.820
My dreams... My life... Everything!

18:04.850 --> 18:09.270
This is the one and only
thing I have to give!

18:10.270 --> 18:11.070
I'm sure...

18:12.480 --> 18:13.480
...Eren will...

18:14.780 --> 18:16.900
...reach... the sea...!

18:19.410 --> 18:20.660
He'll look at...

18:22.700 --> 18:24.620
...the sea for me!

18:32.040 --> 18:33.850
Mikasa! It's too risky!

18:34.550 --> 18:36.590
No, it's perfect!

18:47.390 --> 18:48.560
Hange!

18:50.730 --> 18:52.360
Now's your chance, Mikasa!

18:57.360 --> 18:58.280
She can't be...

18:59.490 --> 19:00.530
Reiner!

19:00.910 --> 19:01.780
Come out!

19:16.670 --> 19:17.910
It's over...

19:20.720 --> 19:23.470
Next is Eren and the horses...

19:29.270 --> 19:30.390
That's...

19:32.310 --> 19:33.440
...hardening?

19:40.400 --> 19:41.240
Gotcha!

19:55.710 --> 19:57.200
A diversion?!

19:58.130 --> 20:01.720
Which means Eren tricking me
into thinking he couldn't move...

20:02.220 --> 20:03.830
...and all Armin's stalling...

20:04.430 --> 20:08.980
...was just to buy Eren enough time
to make a replica hardened Titan!

20:17.190 --> 20:22.070
They did it... to make me think
there weren't any enemies nearby...

20:22.860 --> 20:25.890
To make me... lower my guard...

20:53.310 --> 20:56.150
Have I ever lied to you in my life?

20:58.520 --> 21:01.850
Dammit, I should've known...

21:06.370 --> 21:09.030
Hey, why don't you fight back?

21:09.660 --> 21:10.570
Huh?

21:13.040 --> 21:15.350
They pick on you 'cuz you don't hit back.

21:15.670 --> 21:17.500
Are you fine with losing forever?

21:20.170 --> 21:22.970
I'm... not losing.

21:23.420 --> 21:24.350
Huh?

21:26.680 --> 21:28.680
Because I don't run.

21:35.560 --> 21:37.810
Hey, what's your name?

21:37.810 --> 21:38.360
Huh?

21:49.330 --> 21:52.950
I knew... you were more of a hero...

21:55.960 --> 21:57.570
...than anyone else.

23:40.640 --> 23:43.870
Finding resolve, Eren and the
others defeat their enemies.

23:44.400 --> 23:48.430
However, what they lost cost
more than what they won.

23:48.860 --> 23:51.560
The despair alone has left them stunned.

23:52.480 --> 23:54.500
Next episode: "Midnight Sun."

23:54.501 --> 23:56.540
"Midnight Sun"
